# Agent splits the heredoc terminator with backslash-newline under an
# unquoted marker: the shell joins the lines and ends the heredoc early,
# so the lines after it run; such a body is never data (ADR-0037,
# ADR-0043, ADR-0049; implementer finding G3)
command: cargo xtask guard
expect: could modify the harness file `xtask
stdin: {"session_id": "selftest", "tool_name": "Bash", "tool_input": {"command": "git commit -F - <<EOF\nnotes\nEO\\\nF\nrm -rf xtask\nEOF"}, "hook_event_name": "PreToolUse"}
